The '''Ubese''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]]<ref name="Thermal Detonator">{{Databank|thermal-detonator|Thermal Detonator}}</ref> that spoke [[Ubese (language)|Ubese]].<ref name="Episode VI" /> Originating from the [[planet]] [[Uba IV]], the Ubese were notoriously isolationist, rarely conducting trade with off-worlders. When an Ubese was exiled from Uba IV, their identities were removed from Ubese public record, and they were unable to return and reintegrate into their society.<ref name="Boushh 1" />

[[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] impersonated the Ubese [[bounty]] hunter [[Boushh]]<ref name="Thermal Detonator" /> when she infiltrated the [[Boba Fett's Palace|palace]] of [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|Jabba]] the [[Hutt]].<ref name="Episode VI" />

